sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as App Client
    participant HealthCtrl as Health<br/>Controller
    participant HealthSvc as Health<br/>Service
    participant MLModule as ML Model<br/>Module
    participant DB as Database
    participant NotifSvc as Notification<br/>Service

    Client->>HealthCtrl: POST /health (vitals payload)
    HealthCtrl->>HealthSvc: Validate payload + user session
    HealthSvc->>HealthSvc: normalize_vitals()
    HealthSvc->>DB: INSERT health_data
    DB-->>HealthSvc: DB ack (record id)
    HealthSvc->>MLModule: predict_health_assessment(vitals)
    MLModule-->>HealthSvc: risk_score + risk_label
    HealthSvc->>DB: UPDATE health_data with risk
    DB-->>HealthSvc: DB update ack
    alt High Risk Score
        HealthSvc->>NotifSvc: if high-risk then create alert
        NotifSvc->>DB: INSERT alert + enqueue push
        DB-->>NotifSvc: alert stored
        NotifSvc-->>HealthSvc: return alert status
    end
    HealthSvc-->>HealthCtrl: 201 Created + risk summary
    HealthCtrl-->>Client: JSON response to client
